1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,319
If you followed suitcase monkey over the last couple of years you've seen us travel far and wide around the globe.
如果你这几年一直关注 Suitcase Monkey，就看过我们在世界各地旅行。

2
00:00:06,329 --> 00:00:12,600
Well we thought it was about time that we welcome you properly to our home country of the united kingdom.
我们觉得，是时候好好欢迎你来到我们的祖国——英国了。

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:19,159
On this trip my wife and I will be leaving the frantic london life behind for the calming city of bath.
这趟旅行，我和妻子会暂别忙乱的伦敦生活，前往让人平静的巴斯。

4
00:00:19,159 --> 00:00:24,810
Located in the southwest of England bath is home to the uk's only natural hot springs.
巴斯位于英格兰西南部；按作者的介绍，这里有英国唯一的天然温泉。

5
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:29,880
Where you can bathe just like the romans did albeit in a slightly more elegant surrounding.
你可以像罗马人那样泡澡，只是环境稍微雅致一些。

6
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:38,420
We will be navigating its numerous streets sampling some local musty cuisine and trekking along one of its many countryside walks.
我们会穿行在城里许多街道间，品尝当地美食，还会走一条乡间步道。

7
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:45,080
This is suitcase monkey having a weekend away in the old roman city of bath.
这里是 Suitcase Monkey，我们要在古老的罗马城市巴斯度过一个周末。

8
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:11,650
We began with an early morning wake up whoops the 9 00 a m train from london paddington returning the next day in the late afternoon.
我们一早起床——哎呀——坐伦敦帕丁顿出发的上午九点那班火车，第二天下午晚些时候返回。

9
00:01:11,650 --> 00:01:15,910
Taking only 90 minutes from london it's an easy direct service.
从伦敦只需九十分钟，是一趟方便的直达列车。

10
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:23,619
And whether you're a local wanting a weekend away or a foreign visitor wanting to see more than just the capital bath is well worth the journey.
无论你是想出门过周末的本地人，还是想多看看首都以外地方的外国游客，作者都觉得巴斯很值得一去。

11
00:01:23,629 --> 00:01:29,020
You could skim over it in one very long day but we wanted to get the most out of the city.
你可以用很长的一天匆匆看过它，但我们想尽可能充分地体验这座城市。

12
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:35,210
Upon arrival into bath spa station we took a meandering beeline towards our hotel.
到达巴斯温泉车站后，我们一路曲曲折折地朝酒店走去。

13
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:42,820
Greeted by buskers and market traders things already felt nicely into a slower pace.
沿途有街头艺人和集市摊贩迎接我们，一切很快就自然地慢了下来。

14
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:48,640
After dropping off our bags at our hotel we headed straight back into the streets.
在酒店放下行李后，我们马上又回到了街上。

15
00:01:48,640 --> 00:02:03,980
One of the nicest things about bath is that it is incredibly walkable with pretty much everything being within 10 or 15 minutes of each other.
巴斯最让人喜欢的一点，是特别适合步行；几乎各处彼此之间都只隔十到十五分钟的步行路程。

16
00:02:03,990 --> 00:02:11,100
Our first point of call was the roman baths themselves which is the must do attraction in the city.
我们的第一站就是罗马浴场本身，作者认为这是城里必看的景点。

17
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:16,870
It can get quite busy at peak times but I'm told the queue rarely goes beyond 30 minutes.
高峰时段那里会很忙，不过听说排队很少超过三十分钟。

18
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:23,400
You can pre book your tickets online but for us things move pretty quickly and we were inside before we knew it.
票可以提前在网上预订；但我们这次队伍走得挺快，没多久就进去了。

19
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:32,550
There are only two roman baths in the world that still have natural hot spring water flowing into them and this is one of them.
作者说，世界上只有两处罗马浴场仍有天然温泉水流入，这里就是其中之一。

20
00:02:32,550 --> 00:02:39,080
Included in the price of admission are handy audio guides which make the roman remains come to life even more.
门票包含好用的语音导览，让这些罗马遗迹显得更加鲜活。

21
00:02:39,090 --> 00:02:47,370
Hearing the stories behind the relics some 2 000 years old do a great job of connecting you to the reality of the roman world.
听着那些遗物背后的故事——有些已有两千年历史——会让你更贴近真实的罗马世界。

22
00:02:47,370 --> 00:02:51,750
But the sistine chapel here is obviously the baths themselves.
不过，这里的“西斯廷礼拜堂”，显然还是浴场本身。

23
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:57,910
Walking on the same exact pavement as the romans did two millennia ago is something in itself.
能踩在两千年前罗马人走过的同一片地面上，这件事本身就很特别。

24
00:02:57,910 --> 00:03:04,130
This was once a place for public bathing entertainment healing and of course cleanliness.
这里曾是人们公共沐浴、娱乐、疗养，当然还有清洁身体的地方。

25
00:03:04,140 --> 00:03:10,970
Nowadays its purpose may have shifted somewhat but it is still as essential to bath as it ever was.
如今，它的用途或许已有些改变，但它对巴斯而言仍像从前一样不可或缺。
